msgstr "Un borrador de memoria está esperando tu revisión."

#. Notification body: the user lost access to a shared item because it became a site item.
#: lib/mythweaver/notifications.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It moved to the site."
msgstr "Se movió al sitio."

#. Notification body: the user lost access to a catalog item because a moderator took it down.
#: lib/mythweaver/notifications.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It was removed by a moderator."
msgstr "Un moderador lo retiró."

#. Notification body: the user lost access to a shared item because its owner's account was deleted.
#: lib/mythweaver/notifications.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Its owner's account was deleted."
msgstr "Se eliminó la cuenta de su propietario."

#. Notification title (popup, inbox, push) when a memory draft of a chat waits for the user's review.
#: lib/mythweaver/notifications.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Memory to review — %{chat_title}"
msgstr "Memoria para revisar — %{chat_title}"

#. Notification title (popup, inbox, push) when a regenerated reply (a swipe) of a character finished.
#: lib/mythweaver/notifications.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "New swipe from %{character_name} — %{chat_title}"
msgstr "Nueva variante de %{character_name} — %{chat_title}"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/push_devices.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Notifications are blocked for this site. Allow them in the browser's site settings, then reload the page."
msgstr "Las notificaciones están bloqueadas para este sitio. Permítelas en los ajustes del sitio del navegador y vuelve a cargar la página."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/push_devices.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "On iPhone and iPad, push works only in the installed app: tap Share, then Add to Home Screen, open %{app_name} from the Home Screen and enable push there."
msgstr "En iPhone y iPad, las notificaciones push solo funcionan en la app instalada: toca Compartir, luego Añadir a pantalla de inicio, abre %{app_name} desde la pantalla de inicio y activa las notificaciones push allí."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/push_devices.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Push is off for this browser."
msgstr "Las notificaciones push están desactivadas en este navegador."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/push_devices.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Push is on for this browser."
msgstr "Las notificaciones push están activadas en este navegador."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/push_devices.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Push needs the app served over HTTPS, or opened on localhost on this computer. The README's Deploying section lists ways to serve it."
msgstr "Las notificaciones push requieren que la app se sirva por HTTPS o se abra en localhost en este equipo. La sección Deploying del README indica formas de servirla."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/push_devices.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Push notifications reach a device even with %{app_name} closed, for the kinds ticked in the Push column. Enable push on each phone or computer you want them on. Nothing is pushed while you are looking at the app."
msgstr "Las notificaciones push llegan a un dispositivo aunque %{app_name} esté cerrado, para los tipos marcados en la columna Push. Activa las notificaciones push en cada teléfono o equipo en el que quieras recibirlas. No se envía nada mientras estás mirando la app."

#. Push notification body sent when the user taps “test” on one of their push devices.
#: lib/mythweaver/notifications.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Push notifications work on %{device_name}."
msgstr "Las notificaciones push funcionan en %{device_name}."

